swarm.yml, for example in https://github.com/zyqCSL/sinan-local/blob/master/benchmarks/socialNetwork-ml-swarm/docker-compose-swarm.yml#L17-L19. The compose file assumes two types of servers, tagged with 'data' and 'compute' correspondingly.) \n "}]}